---
// Footer.astro
---
<footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-border pt-16">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1400px] flex-col gap-10 px-5 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between md:px-10">
    <div>
      <a aria-label="Ananta Cast home" href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 20" class="h-4 w-auto" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M16 10c-3-4.5-5.5-7-9-7a7 7 0 1 0 0 14c3.5 0 6-2.5 9-7Zm0 0c3 4.5 5.5 7 9 7a7 7 0 1 0 0-14c-3.5 0-6 2.5-9 7Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"></path>
          <circle cx="25" cy="10" r="2.2" class="fill-molten"></circle>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-[0.95rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground">Ananta Cast</span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/60">
        From casting to finished product. Precision investment castings, machined and inspected under one roof.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Footer" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-3 text-sm">
      <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground transition-colors" href="/about">About</a>
      <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground transition-colors" href="/capabilities">Capabilities</a>
      <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground transition-colors" href="/process">Process</a>
      <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground transition-colors" href="/products">Products</a>
      <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground transition-colors" href="/industries">Industries</a>
      <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center text-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground transition-colors" href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <p
    aria-hidden="true"
    id="footer-ananta"
    class="mt-16 px-3 text-center text-[19vw] leading-[0.8] font-semibold tracking-[-0.06em] text-foreground/[0.07] select-none transition-all duration-1000 ease-out"
  >
    ANANTA
  </p>
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1400px] flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border px-5 py-6 font-mono text-[0.7rem] tracking-wider text-foreground/45 uppercase md:flex-row md:justify-between md:px-10">
    <span>© 2026 Ananta Cast. All rights reserved.</span>
    <span>Investment Casting · CNC Machining</span>
  </div>
</footer>
